 "releaseNotes": "• Introducing Whiteboards: map out what you're learning on a canvas that grows with your ideas.\n• Visualize your ideas. Diagram them with stickies, shapes, and connectors.\n• Introducing ink stabilization: smoother, steadier strokes with the pen, pencil, and highlighter.\n• Transcripts are grouped by recording, with speaker labels.\n\nThanks for using Notability.",
